# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI tooling and the agent loop. This repository is PUBLIC and none of this is
# product: the queue, the driver, the reviewer definition, the permission
# config and any assistant instructions stay on the machine that runs them.
#
# .gitignore alone is not enough to guarantee that, for two reasons:
#   - it does NOT untrack a file that is already committed, so a pattern added
#     later is not retroactive; and
#   - a push carries whole trees, so a single bad historical commit publishes
#     everything in it. That is how .claude/ and loop/ reached a public repo
#     on 2026-08-28.
# .git/hooks/pre-push therefore refuses any push containing a commit whose tree
# carries these paths, whatever the phrasing of the push. The hook is the real
# guarantee; this list is the convenience.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
loop/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.mcp.json
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.cursorignore
.aider*
.codeium/
.continue/
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules
.roo/
.cline*
.clinerules
.gemini/
.specstory/
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.log
.idea/
*.iml
